AiTask qa5_t10_working_hours_routing {
  label: 'QA5 T10 Working-Hours Revenue Routing'
  description: 'Reports yesterday’s revenue and order count twice daily, routing delivery by Vietnam working hours and adding a Friday week-to-date wrap-up.'

  brief: @md
    Using @Dataset:ecommerce_official, run fresh queries and evaluate all date/time conditions in Vietnam time (Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh). Calculate the dataset `revenue` metric and the distinct count of `orders.id` for the complete Vietnam calendar day immediately preceding the task run date. Filter each metric by `orders.created_at` according to that complete reporting-day window, and exclude the current partial Vietnam calendar day. Present revenue as currency and identify the reporting date.

    Use the available AI delivery capability to send exactly one report after determining the actual Vietnam local run timestamp and weekday:
    - During working hours — Monday through Friday, from 09:00 inclusive through 18:00 exclusive Vietnam time — post the report to Slack channel **#nhity-test**.
    - At all other Vietnam-local times, including 18:00 or later, before 09:00, and all Saturday/Sunday times, email it to **nhi.ty@holistics.io**.

    The Slack message must begin exactly with **[QA5 T10]**. The email subject must begin exactly with **[QA5 T10]**. Include yesterday’s reporting date, revenue, and distinct order count in every delivered report. Do not send to both destinations.

    On Friday runs in Vietnam time, append one concise, fact-based line labelled `Week so far:` summarizing revenue and distinct order count from Monday 00:00 Vietnam time through the end of the same yesterday reporting date. This Friday wrap-up must use complete calendar days only and must not include any current-day partial data. Do not add a week-so-far line on non-Friday runs. Do not infer causes or make unsupported claims.
  ;;

  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - A fresh query against @Dataset:ecommerce_official calculates the dataset `revenue` metric and distinct `orders.id` count for the complete Vietnam calendar day immediately before the task run date, excluding the current partial Vietnam calendar day.
    - Exactly one delivery is made per task run through the available AI delivery capability: Slack #nhity-test when the actual Vietnam-local run time is Monday–Friday from 09:00 inclusive to 18:00 exclusive; otherwise email nhi.ty@holistics.io.
    - No run sends the report to both Slack and email.
    - Every Slack message begins exactly with [QA5 T10]. Every email subject begins exactly with [QA5 T10]. Each delivery identifies the reporting date and reports currency-formatted revenue plus the distinct order count.
    - Friday Vietnam-local runs append exactly one concise `Week so far:` line containing revenue and distinct order count from Monday 00:00 Vietnam time through the end of yesterday’s reporting date; it excludes current-day partial data.
    - Non-Friday deliveries do not include a week-so-far line, and all reported information is grounded in fresh query results without unsupported causal claims.
  ;;
}